  "title": "MP2T: Add Strip Headers support",
  "description": "This enables the same features as the mpeg_dump Lua script mentioned\non https://wiki.wireshark.org/Tools.\n\nWhen MPEG-2 transport stream packets transmitted inside another protocol,\ne.g. UDP, the layers before the MPEG-2 TS layer can be removed via\nexport PDU with the MPEG2-TS Wiretap encapsulation type,\nproducing a capture file with just MPEG-2 TS packets. That file can\nthen be saved via wiretap into to .ts format (ISO/IEC 13818-1) if\ndesired. As with the Lua script, optional filtering can be applied.",
